  "instructions": [
    "Cut the white fish fillets into small pieces, about 1 inch in size.",
    "Soak the fish pieces in cold water with 1 tablespoon of salt for 10 minutes.",
    "Drain the water, then pat the fish dry with paper towels.",
    "In a bowl, mix together the breadcrumbs, granulated sugar, dried thyme, dried oregano, and garlic powder.",
    "Add the yogurt and mix until a thick batter forms.",
    "Dip each fish piece into the batter, then coat with the breadcrumb mixture.",
    "Heat a wok over medium-high heat with 1 inch of olive oil.",
    "When the oil is hot, add a few fritters to the wok and fry until golden yellow, about 3-4 minutes on each side.",
    "Drain the fritters on paper towels, then serve hot with lemon wedges on the side."
  ],
